# Summary:  Line endings. The event log is 0x0A-terminated by spec
#           (spec/protocol.md §4.1). Nothing in this repository wants CRLF.
#
#           `-text` means git never converts in either direction, which is what a
#           byte-exact fixture requires: a log fixture whose lines gained a 0x0D, or a
#           keypair whose bytes were rewritten, would fail on Windows and pass in CI.

* text=auto eol=lf
*.jsonl   -text
*.key     -text
*.pub     -text
*.parquet binary
*.svg     text eol=lf
